tion":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"o0xILI1ObM"}],"identifier":"id","label":"单细胞最佳实践","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"BOWzkgIJOK"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"介绍","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"PAKhf4xTpM"}],"identifier":"introduction","label":"Introduction","html_id":"introduction","implicit":true,"key":"NVK46u8SgX"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"人体是一台复杂的机器，高度依赖于生命的基本单位——细胞。这些细胞展现出非凡的多样性，类型和功能各不相同，并能在发育过程中、应对疾病时或再生过程中发生重要的状态转变。这种细胞异质性（cellular heterogeneity）体现在它们的结构、功能和基因表达谱上。一旦这种微妙的平衡被打破，便可能导致全身性的失调，进而引发癌症等严重疾病 ","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"ING1QYfjfk"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"Macaulay2017","identifier":"macaulay2017","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Macaulay ","key":"wkpyxB3X2R"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"Zej5kzce3P"}],"key":"onVYwzmaHx"},{"type":"text","value":", 2017","key":"w4J37yqTUJ"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"IvaFaBzu8k"}],"key":"KHhNTzf9GV"},{"type":"text","value":"。因此，理解细胞在正常和扰动状态下如何运作，对于深化我们对整个细胞系统的认识至关重要。","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"ciOqxVJhzD"}],"key":"EFW79kx6Nb"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"为应对这一挑战，研究人员采用了多种策略，其中最有前景的方法之一是在单个细胞水平上对细胞进行剖析。传统上，每个细胞的转录组（transcriptome）主要通过一种称为单细胞 RNA ","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"pi1ZGdM0iJ"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"sequencing","identifier":"term-sequencing","children":[{"type":"text","value":"测序（single-cell RNA sequencing, scRNA-seq）","key":